    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "G155 and the Owner's rule of 2026-10-26: existing profiles stay as they are; the new profile is built beside them." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveCeremonies .
