    backlog:excludesConcern "Any change to the meaning of the planning ceremony, the review ceremony, the retrospective, the refinement event, the impediment or the deployment unit." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "They exist and are in use (G89, G91); the new records sit beside them and refer to them." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveCeremonies .
