backlog:RS_ObligationsFollowStatus skos:scopeNote "Addendum, release 1.440.0 (found by Lineage 20, the first lineage opened under the adaptive profile): the life-cycle sweep of each domain entity (every life-cycle stage covered by a backlog item or a recorded gap) is also owed from Backlogged, the status at which the items that cover an entity are first made; it was asked at Scoped, where the entity is owed and no such item can yet exist. The rule set is otherwise as defined."@en .

